# Issue #1948: the cooperative in-pass deadline check had to land inside
# run()'s retry loop -- before each attempt and before each backoff sleep --
# because the whole point is bounding a lane's overrun to ONE gh call
# sequence rather than the sum of its retries. That machinery (sentinel,
# refusal helper, per-attempt/per-backoff checks, arming hook) cannot move
# to a domain module without moving run() itself. +66 lines over the prior
# live count (987 -> 1053); raised to the next MARK_QUANTUM multiple per
# the ratchet's hand-raise rule.
